{"unit_id":"zhang-lecheng__dsh-mobile-slim#card-zh","repo":"zhang-lecheng/dsh-mobile-slim","commit":"ee475305c1fb97caab0e9e280fcbf57f177237c6","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile-slim 是面向 DSH Web GUI 手机浏览器的轻量界面补丁，通过注册浏览器端 client 插件并注入 CSS，压缩顶栏与输入栏占用的屏幕空间。它隐藏标题栏内容和标签页，保留由配套 mobile-adapt 提供的汉堡菜单；收窄输入区与按钮，默认隐藏统计栏，并允许点击展开、滑动时收起；同时取消代码块标题栏吸顶。适合希望在手机窄屏上阅读 DSH 会话和输入内容的用户。需要把插件放入 Web profile 并在 cordis.patch.yml 注册，且配合 dsh-client-ui-mobile-adapt 使用；不需要额外密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:36-46","lib/client.js:163-210","lib/client.js:212-291","lib/client.js:312-355","cordis.patch.yml:8-10"]}
{"unit_id":"zhang-lecheng__dsh-mobile-slim#card-en","repo":"zhang-lecheng/dsh-mobile-slim","commit":"ee475305c1fb97caab0e9e280fcbf57f177237c6","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-mobile-slim compacts the DSH Web GUI on phones. Its browser client hides header details and tabs, shrinks the composer, hides stats until tapped, collapses it while scrolling, and removes sticky code banners. Register it in the Web profile with dsh-client-ui-mobile-adapt; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:36-46","lib/client.js:163-210","lib/client.js:212-291","lib/client.js:312-355","cordis.patch.yml:8-10"]}
