{"unit_id":"zhang-lecheng__dsh-mobile-slim#feature-1","repo":"zhang-lecheng/dsh-mobile-slim","commit":"ee475305c1fb97caab0e9e280fcbf57f177237c6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile-slim 的功能「手机顶栏精简」：手机视口下隐藏 Web GUI 顶栏右侧控件和标签行，并将标题区隐藏，只留下配套移动适配插件提供的汉堡入口。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:37-46"]}
{"unit_id":"zhang-lecheng__dsh-mobile-slim#feature-2","repo":"zhang-lecheng/dsh-mobile-slim","commit":"ee475305c1fb97caab0e9e280fcbf57f177237c6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile-slim 的功能「紧凑输入栏」：手机会话中的输入栏、按钮和选择器缩小，减少底部占用；首页空会话的大输入框不受收窄规则影响。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:212-248"]}
{"unit_id":"zhang-lecheng__dsh-mobile-slim#feature-3","repo":"zhang-lecheng/dsh-mobile-slim","commit":"ee475305c1fb97caab0e9e280fcbf57f177237c6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile-slim 的功能「输入栏交互收放」：点击输入栏会展开并显示统计 dock，点击外部会收起；键盘布局变化且输入栏仍聚焦时会重新展开。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:257-277"]}
{"unit_id":"zhang-lecheng__dsh-mobile-slim#feature-4","repo":"zhang-lecheng/dsh-mobile-slim","commit":"ee475305c1fb97caab0e9e280fcbf57f177237c6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile-slim 的功能「滚动时收起输入栏」：触摸滑动或滚轮输入会暂时标记页面滚动状态，使输入栏恢复紧凑样式，约 480 毫秒后清除状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:336-355"]}
{"unit_id":"zhang-lecheng__dsh-mobile-slim#feature-5","repo":"zhang-lecheng/dsh-mobile-slim","commit":"ee475305c1fb97caab0e9e280fcbf57f177237c6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile-slim 的功能「取消代码块标题吸顶」：手机视口中将代码块 banner 的定位改为普通文档流，避免其在滚动时覆盖代码内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:201-210"]}
